"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o012"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-p034-mingdi-p0012","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-p034"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o050-mingdi-p0012","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o050"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既夜藏精卒三千人为伏，使参军成公英，督千余骑挑战，敕使佯退。胡果争奔之，因发伏，截其后；首尾进击，大破之，斩首获生以万数","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":143,"end":203,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"贼七千余骑。逆拒军于鹯阴口〖6〗。既扬声军由鹯阴〖7〗，乃潜由（且）〔揟〕次出至武威〖8〗。胡以为神，引还显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":72,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-09fc0acef808d7824108","layer":"original","quote":"帝甚悦，诏曰：“卿逾河历险，以劳击逸，以寡胜众；功过南仲〖10〗，勤逾吉甫〖11〗。此勋非但破胡，乃永宁河右：使吾长无西顾之念矣！”徙封西乡侯，增邑二百；并前四百户","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"帝忧之，曰：“非既莫能安凉州。”乃召邹岐，以既代之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"诏曰：“昔贾复请击郾贼〖3〗，光武笑曰：‘执金吾击郾，吾复何忧？’卿谋略过人，今则其时。以便宜从事，勿复先请","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"既至金城，欲渡河，诸将、守以为：“兵少道险，未可深入。”既曰：“道虽险，非井陉之隘；夷狄乌合，无左车之计〖5〗。今武威危急，赴之宜速！”遂渡河","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等，继其后","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":109,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"胡骑数千，因大风欲放火烧营，将士皆恐","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":124,"end":142,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"凉州卢水胡伊健妓妾、治元多等反〖2〗，河西大扰","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既已据武威，曜乃至，儒等犹未达。既劳赐将士，欲进军击胡。诸将皆曰：“士卒疲倦，虏众气锐，难与争锋。”既曰：“今军无现粮，当因敌为资。若虏见兵合，退依深山；追之则道险穷饿，兵还则出候寇抄。如此，兵不得解，所谓‘一日纵敌，患在数世’也。”遂前，军显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o012c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c12480a98111a703af26","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，诏公卿近臣举良将〖21〗，各一人。十一月，司徒王朗薨。十二月，诸葛亮围陈仓；曹真遣将军费曜等拒之。﹝五﹞辽东太守公孙恭兄子渊，劫夺恭位；遂以渊领辽东太守。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o012","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c12480a98111a703af26","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，诏公卿近臣举良将〖21〗，各一人。十一月，司徒王朗薨。十二月，诸葛亮围陈仓；曹真遣将军费曜等拒之。﹝五﹞辽东太守公孙恭兄子渊，劫夺恭位；遂以渊领辽东太守。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-p080a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f526d1a1f2ac1dd03e36","layer":"pei","quote":"十一月辛未，镇西将军曹真命众将及州郡兵，讨破叛胡治元多、卢水封赏等。斩首五万余级，获生口十万，羊一百一十一万口，牛八万，河西遂平。","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dea0b21111fc3c1b95dd","start":10,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o050b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-5ac9ec515b6c58df35a9","layer":"original","quote":"张进等反于酒泉，真遣费曜讨破之，斩进等。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o050","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-5ac9ec515b6c58df35a9","layer":"original","quote":"文帝即王位，以真为镇西将军，假节，都督雍、凉州诸军事〖6〗。录前后功，进封东乡侯。张进等反于酒泉，真遣费曜讨破之，斩进等。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-p034b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e243fc402cbd081e76a6","layer":"pei","quote":"于是魏大司马曹真有疾，司马宣王自荆州入朝。魏明帝曰：‘西方事重，非君莫可付者。’乃使西屯长安，督张郃、费曜、戴陵、郭淮等。宣王使曜、陵留精兵四千，守上邽，余众悉出，西救祁山。郃欲分兵驻雍、郿，宣王曰：‘料前军能独当之者，将军言是也；若不能当而分为前后，此楚之三军所以为黥布擒也。’遂进。","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":303,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4ccac388dda92e215134","start":37,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-p034c-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e243fc402cbd081e76a6","layer":"pei","quote":"亮分兵留攻，自逆宣王于上邽。郭淮、费曜等邀亮，亮破之，因大芟刈其麦；与宣王遇于上邽之东，敛兵依险，军不得交，亮引而还。","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":303,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4ccac388dda92e215134","start":180,"end":239,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p034","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e243fc402cbd081e76a6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“亮围祁山，招鲜卑轲比能；比能等至故北地吕城以应亮。于是魏大司马曹真有疾，司马宣王自荆州入朝。魏明帝曰：‘西方事重，非君莫可付者。’乃使西屯长安，督张郃、费曜、戴陵、郭淮等。宣王使曜、陵留精兵四千，守上邽，余众悉出，西救祁山。郃欲分兵驻雍、郿，宣王曰：‘料前军能独当之者，将军言是也；若不能当而分为前后，此楚之三军所以为黥布擒也。’遂进。亮分兵留攻，自逆宣王于上邽。郭淮、费曜等邀亮，亮破之，因大芟刈其麦；与宣王遇于上邽之东，敛兵依险，军不得交，亮引而还。宣王寻亮，至于卤城。张郃曰：‘彼远来逆我，请战不得；谓我利在不战，欲以长计制之也。且祁山知大军已在近，人情自固；可止屯于此，分为奇兵，示出其后；不宜进前而不敢逼，坐失民望也。今亮悬军食少，亦行去矣。’宣王不从，故寻亮。既至，又登山掘营，不肯战。贾栩、魏平，数请战，因曰：‘公畏蜀如虎，奈天下笑何！’宣王病之。诸将咸请战，五月辛巳，乃使张郃攻无当监何平于南围，自案中道向亮。亮使魏延、高翔、吴班赴拒，大破之，获甲首三千级，玄铠五千领，角弩三千一百张。宣王还保营。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":303,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4ccac388dda92e215134","start":0,"end":470,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
